  "description": "Adafruit Micro-Lipo Charger for LiPoly Batt with USB Type C Jack (product 4410) as published: USB-C 5 V with 5.1 kΩ on CC1 and CC2 into an MCP73831 linear charger, 100 mA set by 10 kΩ on PROG, 2.2 kΩ in parallel through the solder jumper SJ1 for the 500 mA mode, a red LED that lights while charging and a green one when the charge is complete on STAT, the cell on a JST PH connector, the breakout pads 5V, D−, D+, GND, VBAT. Transcribed for edakit's tests.",
  "purpose": {
